  "findings": [
    "All four short runs lose4HP to first Boss at tick3755 (125.1667sec). Seed25 then loses6HP to three Heavy by166.5sec, before Harvest unlock.",
    "Seeds4/20/28 die around244-245sec after second Boss and Heavy contacts. Fixed arrival times explain clusters; there is no arbitrary death timer.",
    "Bosses that leak have less integrated multi-tip coverage and fewer hits, while starting mean pressure is nearly equal. Largest tip gap alone does not distinguish outcomes.",
    "Farming branches early: by first Boss contact SupplyLv2, DamageLv3, SpeedLv2,6-7tips. Pressure dilution is shared across seeds, not enough alone to explain directional variation.",
    "All leaking first Bosses had geometric exposure, so a fully blind no-range gap is not supported. Directional overlap, cooldown allocation and earlier-ETA competing targets jointly limit damage.",
    "Wave15 Harvest cannot explain seed25 failure and earlier boss/Heavy damage in other short runs."
  ],
