      "hypothesis": "Spread siblings and increase overlapping directional coverage away from initial three lobes",
      "risks": "Can reduce coverage density on old lanes or extend strong seeds beyond480sec; no success claim"
    },
    {
      "id": "B",
      "change": "When adding branches at radius limit, choose currently least-covered angular sector with deterministic tie break",
      "hypothesis": "Address spatial concentration directly rather than using largest gap as an outcome predictor",
